      },
      {
        "text": "In a later siege exchange, Fist stone Gu sends an enormous fist-shaped stone through the sky with a rumbling sound. It smashes a wall, leaves a deep crater, and spreads cracks so Gu Masters on that stretch lose balance and fall. That smashed stretch is already near collapse when Fang Yuan later aims a wolf assault at it.",
